 "A Unified Programmatic, Semantic, and Visual Interface for General Agents": "面向通用智能体的程序化、语义与视觉统一接口",
 "<span>Haoqing Wang<sup>1*</sup></span><span>Xiaoyi Zhang<sup>1†</sup></span><span>Sicheng Fan<sup>2</sup></span><span>Zhexin Zhang<sup>3</sup></span><span>Xinjie Zhang<sup>1</sup></span><span>Jiahao Li<sup>1</sup></span><span>Bin Li<sup>1</sup></span><span>Yan Lu<sup>1</sup></span>": "<span>Haoqing Wang<sup>1*</sup></span><span>Xiaoyi Zhang<sup>1†</sup></span><span>Sicheng Fan<sup>2</sup></span><span>Zhexin Zhang<sup>3</sup></span><span>Xinjie Zhang<sup>1</sup></span><span>Jiahao Li<sup>1</sup></span><span>Bin Li<sup>1</sup></span><span>Yan Lu<sup>1</sup></span>",
