 "Three channels, one desktop": "三个通道，同一桌面",
 "HCU adds two MCP tools, AX and GUI, next to the agent's own code tools. All three channels change the same desktop, so HCU checks live state before every input.": "HCU 在智能体自带的代码工具旁增加 AX 和 GUI 两个 MCP 工具。三个通道改动同一个桌面，所以 HCU 在每次输入前都会检查实时状态。",
 "Programmatic": "程序化",
 "Edit files, query databases, and run CLI tools directly. This channel is the agent's native shell; HCU does not wrap it.": "直接编辑文件、查询数据库、运行 CLI 工具。这个通道就是智能体原生的 shell，HCU 不做封装。",
 "<b>Shared state.</b> Code changes are visible to the next AX or GUI call.": "<b>共享状态。</b>代码所做的改动，对下一次 AX 或 GUI 调用直接可见。",
 "Semantic": "语义",
 "AX": "AX",
 "Read a compact control tree, find elements, and run a batch of up to 64 actions on short refs, with in-call waits. Each batch reports a diff.": "读取精简控件树，查找元素，并按短 ref 批量执行最多 64 个动作，调用内可等待。每个批次都会返回 diff。",
 "<b>Target guard.</b> HCU resolves every ref again against the live tree and its window before input.": "<b>目标校验。</b>输入前，HCU 会对照实时树和所属窗口重新解析每个 ref。",
 "Visual": "视觉",
 "GUI": "GUI",
 "See the full desktop at 1366 × 768, zoom into small text, and click, drag, scroll, and type in one batch. Use GUI for canvases, images, and controls that AX cannot read.": "以 1366 × 768 查看完整桌面，放大小字，并在一个批次里点击、拖拽、滚动和输入。对画布、图像以及 AX 无法读取的控件使用 GUI。",
 "<b>Layout guard.</b> Coordinates belong to the last screenshot. If the window under a point moved, closed, or was covered, HCU sends no input and returns a fresh screenshot.": "<b>布局校验。</b>坐标对应上一张截图。如果坐标下的窗口已移动、关闭或被遮挡，HCU 不发送输入，而是返回一张新截图。",
 "One AX call, from tree to diff": "一次 AX 调用，从树到 diff",
 "In a typical AX action call, the model sends one batch. HCU resolves the refs, dispatches the actions, waits, and reports the change in the same round trip.": "在典型的 AX 动作调用中，模型发送一个批次。HCU 在同一趟往返里解析 ref、派发动作、等待并报告变更。",
 "<span class=\"step-no\">1</span>Project the tree": "<span class=\"step-no\">1</span>精简无障碍树",
 "HCU reads the accessibility tree (169 nodes for Chrome settings) and shows the model a 73-line view that keeps every control the model can act on.": "HCU 读取无障碍树（Chrome 设置有 169 个节点），向模型展示 73 行视图，保留模型可操作的每个控件。",
 "<span class=\"step-no\">2</span>Send one batch": "<span class=\"step-no\">2</span>发送一个批次",
 "The model sends a batch with an in-call wait instead of one action per model turn.": "模型发送带调用内等待的一个批次，而不是每轮只发一个动作。",
 "<span class=\"step-no\">3</span>Guard and dispatch": "<span class=\"step-no\">3</span>校验并派发",
 "Before each step, HCU resolves the ref against the live tree and its window, sends the native action, and waits until the page stops changing.": "每一步之前，HCU 对照实时无障碍树及所属窗口解析 ref，发送原生动作，并等待页面停止变化。",
 "<span class=\"step-no\">4</span>Return a diff": "<span class=\"step-no\">4</span>返回 diff",
 "HCU returns one status line, the effect on each target, and a diff against the tree before the batch.": "HCU 返回一行状态、在每个目标上的效果，以及相对于该批次前无障碍树的 diff。",
 "The guard in a recorded run": "实录运行中的校验",
 "LibreOffice Writer, OSWorld 1.0 task 0e763. An AX action closes a dialog, and the agent's next GUI batch still uses the old coordinates.": "LibreOffice Writer，OSWorld 1.0 任务 0e763。一个 AX 动作关闭了对话框，智能体的下一个 GUI 批次仍使用旧坐标。",
 "<span class=\"tl-ch\">GUI</span>Screenshot binds the layout": "<span class=\"tl-ch\">GUI</span>截图绑定布局",
