 "<span class=\"tl-ch\">AX</span>AX closes the dialog": "<span class=\"tl-ch\">AX</span>AX 关闭对话框",
 "Clicking <code>r112</code> closes the dialog and returns focus to the document.": "点击 <code>r112</code> 关闭对话框，焦点回到文档。",
