 "Models have not seen HCU's multi-mode contract during training, and some harnesses compact large tool schemas. A short shared skill with call rules and recovery hints removes most malformed calls.": "模型在训练时未见过 HCU 的多模式接口约定，而部分智能体框架会压缩大型工具 schema。一份带调用规则和恢复提示的简短共享 Skill，可消除大多数格式错误的调用。",
