 "<span>HCU Python SDK</span>": "<span>HCU Python SDK</span>",
 "One printed line": "一行打印输出",
 "BibTeX": "BibTeX",
 "Copy": "复制",
 "Hybrid Computer Use · Microsoft Research, Fudan University, Tsinghua University": "Hybrid Computer Use · Microsoft Research、复旦大学、清华大学",
 "GitHub": "GitHub",
 "llms.txt": "llms.txt",
 "* Work done during an internship at Microsoft Research. † Project lead.": "* 在 Microsoft Research 实习期间完成。† 项目负责人。",
 "Gains are over CUA Driver with the same model, harness, and tasks.": "提升幅度均相对 CUA Driver 计算，模型、智能体框架和任务相同。",
 "Illustrative replay on real AX captures, timed at about 7 s per model turn and 2.4K tokens per 1080p screenshot.": "基于真实 AX 采集的示意回放，按每轮约 7 秒、每张 1080p 截图约 2.4K token 计时。",
 "Shell-only tasks change by less than one point in either direction.": "仅用 shell 的任务，得分变化在正负 1 个百分点以内。",
 "With HCU, every model uses AX or GUI in more tasks.": "使用 HCU 后，每个模型都在更多任务中使用 AX 或 GUI。",
 "An illustrative task at each stage. HCU uses AX for text and clicks, and GUI for what only pixels show.": "用一个示意任务对比三个阶段。HCU 用 AX 读取文字并点击，用 GUI 读取只有像素才能显示的内容。",
 "Highest full-set Partial": "全集中 Partial 最高",
 "On OSWorld 2.0, OSWorld 1.0 (five frontier models, four harnesses), WeaveBench, MacAgentBench, and Windows Agent Arena, HCU raises task scores and lowers cost.": "在 OSWorld 2.0、OSWorld 1.0（5 个前沿模型、4 个智能体框架）、WeaveBench、MacAgentBench 和 Windows Agent Arena 上，HCU 提高了任务得分，并降低了成本。",
 "With CUA Driver, GPT-5.4, Gemini 3.8 Flash, and Grok 4.7 still wrote their own <code>pyatspi</code> scripts in 11, 29, and 52 OSWorld 1.0 tasks. With HCU, these counts fell to 5, 13, and 22.": "使用 CUA Driver 时，GPT-5.4、Gemini 3.8 Flash 和 Grok 4.7 仍在 OSWorld 1.0 的 11、29 和 52 个任务中自己编写 <code>pyatspi</code> 脚本。换成 HCU 后，这三个数字降到 5、13 和 22。",
 "<span class=\"tl-ch\">GUI</span>Corrected batch is sent": "<span class=\"tl-ch\">GUI</span>发送修正后的批次",
 "The model moves two clicks, (628, 289) to (626, 292) and (224, 95) to (232, 93), and HCU sends all 7 actions.": "模型修改两处点击坐标，从 (628, 289) 改为 (626, 292)、从 (224, 95) 改为 (232, 93)，HCU 发送全部 7 个动作。",
 "Where the gains come from": "提升从哪里来",
 "Every model scores higher with HCU, and each divides work across the channels differently. Nearly all of the gain comes from tasks where HCU makes at least one AX or GUI request.": "每个模型使用 HCU 后得分都更高，但各自在通道间的分工不同。几乎全部提升都来自 HCU 至少发出一次 AX 或 GUI 请求的任务。",
 "GPT-5.4 sends 80% of desktop requests to AX. Claude Opus 5.5 sends 94% to GUI, and 58% of its acting requests contain two or more actions. On 29% to 31% of the tasks where GPT-5.4, Gemini 3.8 Flash, or Grok 4.7 used GUI, every GUI request was a screenshot and every action went through AX.": "GPT-5.4 把 80% 的桌面请求发往 AX。Claude Opus 5.5 把 94% 发往 GUI，且 58% 的动作请求包含两个或更多动作。在 GPT-5.4、Gemini 3.8 Flash 或 Grok 4.7 使用 GUI 的任务中，有 29% 到 31% 的任务 GUI 请求全是截图，所有动作都通过 AX 执行。",
 "Real AX captures from 9 applications. Hover a box on the screenshot or a line in the tree. Both point to the same control and the same ref.": "采自 9 个应用的真实 AX 数据。把鼠标悬停在截图的方框或 AX 树的行上。两者指向同一个控件和同一个 ref。",
 "We introduce <strong>Hybrid Computer Use (HCU)</strong>. HCU combines three channels in one interface: <span class=\"chw chw-code\">code and command-line tools</span>, <span class=\"chw chw-ax\">accessibility (AX)</span>, and the <span class=\"chw chw-gui\">GUI</span>. HCU is a two-tool MCP server (AX and GUI) that runs beside the agent's own shell and file tools. It returns compact AX working trees with short refs (<code>aN → wN → rN</code>), runs batches of actions with in-call waits, reports post-action AX diffs, and checks live state before it sends any desktop input.": "我们提出 <strong>Hybrid Computer Use（HCU）</strong>。HCU 把三个通道合进一个接口：<span class=\"chw chw-code\">代码与命令行工具</span>、<span class=\"chw chw-ax\">无障碍接口（AX）</span>和 <span class=\"chw chw-gui\">GUI</span>。HCU 是一个提供 AX 和 GUI 两个工具的 MCP 服务器，与智能体自带的 shell 和文件工具配合运行。HCU 返回带短 ref（<code>aN → wN → rN</code>）的精简 AX 工作树，执行含调用内等待的批量动作，返回动作后的 AX diff，并在发送任何桌面输入前检查实时状态。",
 "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"add-vis\"><span class=\"tk tk-ax\">AX</span><span class=\"tk tk-gui\">GUI</span></span><span class=\"add-txt\"><strong>Two MCP tools</strong>, AX and GUI, next to the agent's own shell and file tools.</span>": "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"add-vis\"><span class=\"tk tk-ax\">AX</span><span class=\"tk tk-gui\">GUI</span></span><span class=\"add-txt\"><strong>两个 MCP 工具</strong>（AX 和 GUI），与智能体自带的 shell 和文件工具并列。</span>",
 "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"add-vis add-refs\"><b>a1</b>›<b>w1</b>›<b>r12</b></span><span class=\"add-txt\"><strong>Short refs</strong> such as <code>a1 → w1 → r12</code> that stay bound to one window.</span>": "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"add-vis add-refs\"><b>a1</b>›<b>w1</b>›<b>r12</b></span><span class=\"add-txt\"><strong>短 ref</strong>（如 <code>a1 → w1 → r12</code>），始终绑定到同一个窗口。</span>",
 "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"add-vis\"><span class=\"add-batch\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"add-txt\"><strong>Batches</strong> of up to 64 actions with in-call waits and a diff.</span>": "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"add-vis\"><span class=\"add-batch\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"add-txt\"><strong>批次</strong>，一次调用最多 64 个动作，可在调用内等待，并返回 diff。</span>",
 "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"add-vis add-guard\"><b>r13</b><em>✓</em><b>x,y</b><em>✓</em></span><span class=\"add-txt\"><strong>Guards</strong> that check the target and the layout before any input.</span>": "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"add-vis add-guard\"><b>r13</b><em>✓</em><b>x,y</b><em>✓</em></span><span class=\"add-txt\"><strong>校验</strong>，在发送任何输入前检查目标和布局。</span>",
 "<span class=\"pr-lab\">Screenshot loop</span><span class=\"pr-blocks\"><i data-at=\"1\"></i><i class=\"img gone\" data-at=\"2\" data-off=\"4\"></i><i data-at=\"3\"></i><i class=\"img gone\" data-at=\"4\" data-off=\"6\"></i><i data-at=\"5\"></i><i class=\"img\" data-at=\"6\"></i></span><span class=\"pr-note is-miss\" data-at=\"4\" data-hit=\"6\">cache miss</span>": "<span class=\"pr-lab\">截图循环</span><span class=\"pr-blocks\"><i data-at=\"1\"></i><i class=\"img gone\" data-at=\"2\" data-off=\"4\"></i><i data-at=\"3\"></i><i class=\"img gone\" data-at=\"4\" data-off=\"6\"></i><i data-at=\"5\"></i><i class=\"img\" data-at=\"6\"></i></span><span class=\"pr-note is-miss\" data-at=\"4\" data-hit=\"6\">缓存失效</span>",
 "<span class=\"pr-lab\">Agent harness</span><span class=\"pr-blocks is-cached\"><i data-at=\"1\" data-hit=\"2\"></i><i data-at=\"2\" data-hit=\"3\"></i><i data-at=\"3\" data-hit=\"4\"></i><i data-at=\"4\" data-hit=\"5\"></i><i data-at=\"5\" data-hit=\"6\"></i><i class=\"new\" data-at=\"6\"></i></span><span class=\"pr-note is-hit\" data-at=\"2\">cached</span>": "<span class=\"pr-lab\">智能体框架</span><span class=\"pr-blocks is-cached\"><i data-at=\"1\" data-hit=\"2\"></i><i data-at=\"2\" data-hit=\"3\"></i><i data-at=\"3\" data-hit=\"4\"></i><i data-at=\"4\" data-hit=\"5\"></i><i data-at=\"5\" data-hit=\"6\"></i><i class=\"new\" data-at=\"6\"></i></span><span class=\"pr-note is-hit\" data-at=\"2\">命中缓存</span>",
 "<span data-at=\"1\" data-off=\"7\"><em>window</em> \"Save As\"</span><span class=\"d1\" data-at=\"2\" data-hit=\"4\" data-off=\"7\"><em>textbox</em> \"File name\" <b>r11</b></span><span class=\"d1\" data-at=\"3\" data-hit=\"5\" data-off=\"7\"><em>button</em> \"Save\" <b>r13</b></span>": "<span data-at=\"1\" data-off=\"7\"><em>window</em> \"Save As\"</span><span class=\"d1\" data-at=\"2\" data-hit=\"4\" data-off=\"7\"><em>textbox</em> \"File name\" <b>r11</b></span><span class=\"d1\" data-at=\"3\" data-hit=\"5\" data-off=\"7\"><em>button</em> \"Save\" <b>r13</b></span>",
 "<span class=\"pr-lab\">Shared desktop</span><span class=\"calls\"><b data-at=\"1\"><i></i></b><b data-at=\"2\"><i class=\"no\" data-hit=\"3\"></i></b><b data-at=\"3\"><i></i></b><b data-at=\"4\"><i></i></b></span><span class=\"pr-note\" data-at=\"4\">4 calls</span>": "<span class=\"pr-lab\">共享桌面</span><span class=\"calls\"><b data-at=\"1\"><i></i></b><b data-at=\"2\"><i class=\"no\" data-hit=\"3\"></i></b><b data-at=\"3\"><i></i></b><b data-at=\"4\"><i></i></b></span><span class=\"pr-note\" data-at=\"4\">4 次调用</span>",
 "<span class=\"pr-lab\">Own computer</span><span class=\"calls\"><b class=\"wide\" data-at=\"1\" data-hit=\"2\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></b></span><span class=\"pr-note is-hit\" data-at=\"2\">1 call</span>": "<span class=\"pr-lab\">独立计算机</span><span class=\"calls\"><b class=\"wide\" data-at=\"1\" data-hit=\"2\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></b></span><span class=\"pr-note is-hit\" data-at=\"2\">1 次调用</span>",
 "<span class=\"mb-name\">GPT-5.4</span><span class=\"mb-bars\"><i class=\"is-base\" style=\"--w:21.2%\"></i><i class=\"is-ours\" style=\"--w:9.6%\"></i></span><span class=\"mb-val\">11 → 5</span>": "<span class=\"mb-name\">GPT-5.4</span><span class=\"mb-bars\"><i class=\"is-base\" style=\"--w:21.2%\"></i><i class=\"is-ours\" style=\"--w:9.6%\"></i></span><span class=\"mb-val\">11 → 5</span>",
 "<span class=\"mb-name\">Gemini 3.8 Flash</span><span class=\"mb-bars\"><i class=\"is-base\" style=\"--w:55.8%\"></i><i class=\"is-ours\" style=\"--w:25%\"></i></span><span class=\"mb-val\">29 → 13</span>": "<span class=\"mb-name\">Gemini 3.8 Flash</span><span class=\"mb-bars\"><i class=\"is-base\" style=\"--w:55.8%\"></i><i class=\"is-ours\" style=\"--w:25%\"></i></span><span class=\"mb-val\">29 → 13</span>",
 "<span class=\"mb-name\">Grok 4.7</span><span class=\"mb-bars\"><i class=\"is-base\" style=\"--w:100%\"></i><i class=\"is-ours\" style=\"--w:42.3%\"></i></span><span class=\"mb-val\">52 → 22</span>": "<span class=\"mb-name\">Grok 4.7</span><span class=\"mb-bars\"><i class=\"is-base\" style=\"--w:100%\"></i><i class=\"is-ours\" style=\"--w:42.3%\"></i></span><span class=\"mb-val\">52 → 22</span>",
 "<span><i class=\"sw-base\"></i>CUA Driver</span><span><i class=\"sw-ours\"></i>HCU</span>": "<span><i class=\"sw-base\"></i>CUA Driver</span><span><i class=\"sw-ours\"></i>HCU</span>",
 "Desktop products, web agents, and OS baselines already read the accessibility tree. HCU adds ref-bound actions and batches that report a diff.": "桌面产品、Web 智能体和 OS 基线都已经能读取无障碍树。HCU 在此基础上增加了绑定 ref 的动作，以及会返回 diff 的批量动作。",
 "Cost": "开销",
 "14 claims": "14 笔",
 "140 claims": "140 笔",
 "<b data-a=\"~50\" data-b=\"~500\">~50</b> model turns": "<b data-a=\"~50\" data-b=\"~500\">~50</b> 轮",
 "<b data-a=\"~50\" data-b=\"~500\">~50</b> full screenshots · <b data-a=\"~6\" data-b=\"~58\">~6</b> min": "<b data-a=\"~50\" data-b=\"~500\">~50</b> 张整屏截图 · <b data-a=\"~6\" data-b=\"~58\">~6</b> 分钟",
 "<b data-a=\"~16\" data-b=\"~142\">~16</b> model turns": "<b data-a=\"~16\" data-b=\"~142\">~16</b> 轮",
 "<b data-a=\"14\" data-b=\"140\">14</b> receipt crops · <b data-a=\"~2\" data-b=\"~17\">~2</b> min": "<b data-a=\"14\" data-b=\"140\">14</b> 张收据裁图 · <b data-a=\"~2\" data-b=\"~17\">~2</b> 分钟",
 "<b>1</b> model turn": "<b>1</b> 轮",
 "<b>0</b> images, one printed line · <b>~7</b> s": "<b>0</b> 张图片，只读一行输出 · <b>~7</b> 秒",
 "One expense review. Time counts only model waiting, at about 7 s per turn.": "同一个报销审核任务。时间只计等待模型的部分，按每轮约 7 秒估算。",
 "GUI and AX control both moved from one action per model turn to batches. The next step joins the two lines in one program.": "GUI 和 AX 控制都从模型每轮只发一个动作演进到批量执行。下一步是把两条路线合进同一个程序。",
 "<strong>GUI, AX, and ordinary code in one program.</strong> AX state becomes variables to loop and branch on. Screenshots from pyautogui stay in the program; only the result returns to the model.": "<strong>GUI、AX 与普通代码写在同一个程序里。</strong>AX 状态变成变量，可以直接用来循环和分支。pyautogui 截的图留在程序里，只有结果返回给模型。",
 "OpenAI recommends it for GPT-6 Astra; next for the HCU Python SDK": "OpenAI 建议 GPT-6 Astra 使用代码执行；HCU Python SDK 是下一步",
 "How the layout guard stops a misclick": "布局校验怎样避免点错",
 "A schematic case. An AX action changes the window after the screenshot, so a click planned on the old picture would land on another button.": "示意场景。截图之后，一个 AX 动作改变了窗口，按旧截图计划的点击会落到另一个按钮上。",
 "<span>report.docx · Editor</span><i></i><i></i><i></i>": "<span>report.docx · 编辑器</span><i></i><i></i><i></i>",
 "Comments<b>×</b><em>r8</em>": "批注<b>×</b><em>r8</em>",
 "Old point is now on Delete": "旧坐标现在落在“删除”上",
 "Saved": "已保存",
 "<button data-step=\"1\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tl-dot\">1</span><span class=\"gd-txt\"><span class=\"tl-ch\">GUI</span><strong>Screenshot</strong><span>The model plans a click on Save in this picture. HCU records the layout.</span></span></button>": "<button data-step=\"1\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tl-dot\">1</span><span class=\"gd-txt\"><span class=\"tl-ch\">GUI</span><strong>截图</strong><span>模型在这张截图上计划点击“保存”。HCU 记下当前布局。</span></span></button>",
 "<button data-step=\"2\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tl-dot\">2</span><span class=\"gd-txt\"><span class=\"tl-ch\">AX</span><strong>AX closes the panel</strong><span>The toolbar shifts right. Delete now sits where Save was.</span></span></button>": "<button data-step=\"2\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tl-dot\">2</span><span class=\"gd-txt\"><span class=\"tl-ch\">AX</span><strong>AX 关闭面板</strong><span>工具栏整体右移，“删除”移到了原来“保存”的位置。</span></span></button>",
 "<button data-step=\"3\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tl-dot\">3</span><span class=\"gd-txt\"><span class=\"tl-ch\">Guard</span><strong>Stale click blocked</strong><span>The layout changed since the screenshot. HCU sends nothing and returns a fresh one.</span></span></button>": "<button data-step=\"3\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tl-dot\">3</span><span class=\"gd-txt\"><span class=\"tl-ch\">校验</span><strong>拦下过期点击</strong><span>截图之后布局已经变了。HCU 不发送任何输入，并返回一张新截图。</span></span></button>",
 "<button data-step=\"4\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tl-dot\">4</span><span class=\"gd-txt\"><span class=\"tl-ch\">GUI</span><strong>Corrected click</strong><span>The model clicks Save at its new position.</span></span></button>": "<button data-step=\"4\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tl-dot\">4</span><span class=\"gd-txt\"><span class=\"tl-ch\">GUI</span><strong>修正后的点击</strong><span>模型按新位置点中“保存”。</span></span></button>",
 "Show the calls<span class=\"race-note\">Illustrative replay on real AX captures, timed at about 7 s per model turn and 2.4K tokens per 1080p screenshot.</span>": "查看调用<span class=\"race-note\">基于真实 AX 采集的示意回放，按每轮约 7 秒、每张 1080p 截图约 2.4K token 计时。</span>",
 "Screenshot clicks, single AX actions, and HCU make the same changes from the same start.": "截图点击、单步 AX 动作和 HCU 从同一时刻出发，做出同样的修改。"
